{
  "_comment": "Same nine characteristics as shape-config.json at length 500 instead of 1000. The length sweep exists because at 1000 points with a single clean cause per class every feature family saturates in the 0.95-0.97 band, and a saturated comparison carries no information. Real archives (UCR) are mostly 100-500 points. Shortening the series is the cheapest way to find where each family actually degrades: classical tests lose power as n falls, and persistence has fewer extrema to work with.",
